@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# ========== REPORT USE CASE ==========

### Submit a Report (Report Account)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reporterID": 1,
  "reportedUserID": 2,
  "reason": "Inappropriate behaviour and spam"
}

###

### Submit a Report (Report Content)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reporterID": 1,
  "reportedUserID": 2,
  "reason": "[Content Report] This post contains misinformation and misleading content"
}

###

### Get all reported accounts (Admin)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/reported-accounts
Accept: application/json

###
